### ── GET PROFILE ─────────────────────────

### 1. Get own profile (replace USERNAME with your username)
GET http://localhost:6435/user-api/profile/__sumanmondal
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Get another user's profile
GET http://localhost:6435/user-api/profile/priya_samanta
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 3. Get profile of non-existent user (should return 404)
GET http://localhost:6435/user-api/profile/ghostuser999
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 4. Get profile of blocked user (should return 403)
GET http://localhost:6435/user-api/profile/__sumanmondal
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 5. Get profile of deactivated user (should return 403)
GET http://localhost:6435/user-api/profile/__sumanmondal
Content-Type: application/json

###


### ── UPDATE PROFILE ──────────────────────


### 6. Update profile — text fields only (no image)
PUT http://localhost:6435/user-api/updateProfile
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "UpdatedFirst",
    "lastName": "UpdatedLast",
    "username": "newusername",
    "bio": "This is my updated bio",
    "gender": "male"
}

###

### 7. Update only bio (partial update — other fields stay the same)
PUT http://localhost:6435/user-api/updateProfile
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "bio": "I am the Admin"
}

###

### 8. Update username to one that's already taken (should return 409)
PUT http://localhost:6435/user-api/updateProfile
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "existingusername"
}

###

### NOTE: To test profile image upload, use a REST client that supports
### multipart/form-data — send as form-data with key "profileImageUrl"
### and value as an image file (JPG or PNG only)


### ── DELETE PROFILE IMAGE ─────────────────


### 9. Delete profile image
DELETE http://localhost:6435/user-api/profileImage
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 10. Delete profile image when none exists (should return 400)
### (Run after deleting it once)
DELETE http://localhost:6435/user-api/profileImage
Content-Type: application/json

###


### ── DEACTIVATE ACCOUNT ──────────────────


### 11. Deactivate own account with correct password
PUT http://localhost:6435/user-api/deactivate
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "password": "admin1"
}

###

### 12. Deactivate with wrong password (should return 401)
PUT http://localhost:6435/user-api/deactivate
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "password": "WrongPassword"
}

###

### 13. Deactivate without password field (should return 400)
PUT http://localhost:6435/user-api/deactivate
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###


### ── FOLLOW A USER ───────────────────────


### 14. Follow a user (replace USER_ID with target user's _id)
POST http://localhost:6435/user-api/follow/69faeac33c7351861a94b13a
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 15. Follow yourself (should return 400)
POST http://localhost:6435/user-api/follow/69faedacd45530b84f0b2945
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 16. Follow a user you already follow (should return 400)
POST http://localhost:6435/user-api/follow/69faeac33c7351861a94b13a
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 17. Follow a blocked/deactivated user (should return 403)
POST http://localhost:6435/user-api/follow/69faeac33c7351861a94b13a
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 18. Follow non-existent user (should return 404)
POST http://localhost:6435/user-api/follow/000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

###


### ── UNFOLLOW A USER ─────────────────────


### 19. Unfollow a user you follow (replace USER_ID)
DELETE http://localhost:6435/user-api/unfollow/69faeac33c7351861a94b13a
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 20. Unfollow yourself (should return 400)
DELETE http://localhost:6435/user-api/unfollow/YOUR_OWN_USER_ID
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 21. Unfollow a user you don't follow (should return 400)
DELETE http://localhost:6435/user-api/unfollow/69faeac33c7351861a94b13a
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 22. Unfollow non-existent user (should return 404)
DELETE http://localhost:6435/user-api/unfollow/000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

###


### ── REMOVE A FOLLOWER ───────────────────


### 23. Remove someone from your followers list (replace FOLLOWER_USER_ID)
DELETE http://localhost:6435/user-api/removeFollower/69faedacd45530b84f0b2945
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 24. Remove yourself as follower (should return 400)
DELETE http://localhost:6435/user-api/removeFollower/69faeac33c7351861a94b13a
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 25. Remove someone who is not your follower (should return 400)
DELETE http://localhost:6435/user-api/removeFollower/69faeac33c7351861a94b13a
Content-Type: application/json

###


