### ── FOLLOWING LIST (another user) ───────


### 31. Get following list of another user by username
GET http://localhost:6435/user-api/followinglist/__sumanmondal
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 32. Get following list of blocked/deactivated user (should return 403)
GET http://localhost:6435/user-api/followinglist/blockedusername
