### ── SEARCH USERS ────────────────────────


### 33. Search by username
GET http://localhost:6435/user-api/search?q=P
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 34. Search by first name
GET http://localhost:6435/user-api/search?q=john
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 35. Search with empty query (should return 400)
GET http://localhost:6435/user-api/search?q=
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 36. Search with no query param (should return 400)
GET http://localhost:6435/user-api/search
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 37. Search with special characters (should be safe — regex is escaped)
GET http://localhost:6435/user-api/search?q=__sumanmondal
Content-Type: application/json

###


